{
    "version": "nightly",
    "description": "微信 Windows 版（4.x / Weixin；C 盘用户数据联接到 persist）",
    "homepage": "https://pc.weixin.qq.com/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Proprietary",
        "url": "https://weixin.qq.com/cgi-bin/readtemplate?lang=zh_CN&t=weixin_agreement&s=privacy"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://dldir1v6.qq.com/weixin/Universal/Windows/WeChatWin_4.2.1.exe#/dl.7z"
        }
    },
    "installer": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/wechat/install.ps1'"
    },
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\*\\bin\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/wechat/uninstall.ps1'"
    },
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "Weixin.exe",
            "微信"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": "xwechat_files",
    "notes": [
        "安装包走腾讯 CDN（dldir1v6），与 GitHub 镜像同哈希；版本号取自构建（如 4.2.1.9），CDN 文件名为 WeChatWin_4.2.1.exe。",
        "微信 4.x（Weixin）：%APPDATA%\\Tencent\\xwechat → persist/xwechat（目录联接）。",
        "FileSavePath / ini 写父目录（如 D:\\File）；微信自行拼 xwechat_files。",
        "已有非 C 盘父目录会保留；否则默认 Scoop persist\\wechat（下为 xwechat_files）。",
        "manifest 为 nightly（无 hash）；官网 CDN 可能同址换包，与 dorado todesk / steam 同策略。"
    ]
}
